<title>BOLIVIA: SOCCER-BOLIVIA BEAT JAMAICA 6-0 IN FRIENDLY.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-BOLIVIA BEAT JAMAICA 6-0 IN FRIENDLY.</headline>
<dateline>ORURO, Bolivia 1997-03-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bolivia beat Jamaica 6-0 (halftime 3-0) in a friendly soccer international on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorers: Oscar Sanchez (13th and 62nd minutes), Mauro Blanco (23rd and 90th), Juan Berthy Suarez (26th and 77th)</p>
<p>Attendance: 5,000</p>
